            <p class="mb-0">We ship systems that handle real customers and messy data, with proper error handling, monitoring, and failover from day one.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="col-12 col-sm-6 col-lg-3">
          <div class="build-system-card p-4 h-100">
            <div class="build-icon-wrapper mb-3">
              <div class="build-icon"><i class="fa fa-shield" aria-hidden="true"></i></div>
            </div>
            <h4 class="mb-2">AI with Governance</h4>
            <p class="mb-0">Human-in-the-loop and audit trails are built in from day one. Every AI system we deploy is designed for compliance and board-level confidence.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="col-12 col-sm-6 col-lg-3">
          <div class="build-system-card p-4 h-100">
            <div class="build-icon-wrapper mb-3">
              <div class="build-icon"><i class="fa fa-key" aria-hidden="true"></i></div>
            </div>
            <h4 class="mb-2">Complete Ownership</h4>
            <p class="mb-0">You own all code, infrastructure, and documentation. No lock-in, no proprietary frameworks. Everything we build is yours from the start.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="col-12 col-sm-6 col-lg-3">
          <div class="build-system-card p-4 h-100">
            <div class="build-icon-wrapper mb-3">
              <div class="build-icon"><i class="fa fa-line-chart" aria-hidden="true"></i></div>
            </div>
            <h4 class="mb-2">Measurable Results</h4>
            <p class="mb-0">Success is measured in hours saved, revenue recovered, and capacity increased, not just features shipped. We track outcomes that matter to your business.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

